# DOORS: the squad works the door nearest the nearest man who is not theirs: stacks on it, one pair holds the threshold and clears
# from outside, then all are told to go, fall back in, and one pair stacks and bangs its way in; and again, on whichever door is
# nearest him by then. The pair's own orders come first, while the pair is whole.
# REACHES: the stack order and its places, the word to go, the door tools (open and clear, bang and clear, the threshold held),
# entries and the room fight behind them, shutting a door, the fall-in order. The tool says, a floor, which of these lines the
# game never took there and why.
# DOES NOT REACH: a charge on a door or a wall, the wand, the throws' page, a pair's orders, Sam's gun.
unhurt
every 24 from 1    order stack door all
every 48 from 3    order thresholdHold door blue
every 48 from 5    order openClear door blue
every 24 from 6    order go door all
every 24 from 12   order fallIn sam all
every 24 from 14   order stack door blue
every 24 from 16   order bangClear door blue
every 24 from 8    order shutDoor opendoor all
